00:14:58.940 --> 00:14:59.940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and

asr-000241
00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:07.120
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: enhancing the Corporate Governance Scorecard, and pursuing organizational structuring plans for GOCCs.

asr-000242
00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:16.400
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: In addition to its Tier 1 priorities, the proposed additional budget will also support GCG's Tier 2 initiatives,

asr-000243
00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:20.540
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: aimed at sustaining and enhancing its long-term capabilities.

asr-000244
00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.640
