asr-000248
00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.800
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and the development of strategic local and international initiatives.

asr-000249
00:15:55.640 --> 00:16:01.280
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The budget will also support international partnerships to elevate governance standards across the GOCC sector.

asr-000250
