asr-000523
00:32:54.180 --> 00:33:00.660
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Relative to the fiscal year 2026 budget of 6.79 trillion,

asr-000524
00:33:01.940 --> 00:33:08.140
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: this represents only 0.0089% of the total government appropriations.

asr-000525
00:33:08.940 --> 00:33:12.560
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Nevertheless, with this modest share of the national budget,

asr-000526
00:33:13.460 --> 00:33:16.700
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GCG performs oversight over a GOC sector

asr-000527
00:33:16.700 --> 00:33:18.600
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: that manages trillions.

asr-000528
00:33:19.040 --> 00:33:23.140
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: In addition, the GCG is also responsible for the financial and public assets,

asr-000529
00:33:23.140 --> 00:33:25.520
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: generates revenues for government,

asr-000530
00:33:25.520 --> 00:33:30.020
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and contributes to substantial dividend remittances to the national treasury.

asr-000531
00:33:30.020 --> 00:33:35.180
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The resources entrusted to us are only a small fraction of the value

asr-000532
00:33:35.180 --> 00:33:40.140
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: we help protect, monitor, and optimize on behalf of the Filipino people.

asr-000533
00:33:41.420 --> 00:33:49.020
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Through our governance reforms, performance management, fiscal oversight, digital transformation, and

asr-000534
00:33:49.040 --> 00:33:57.500
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: accountability measures, the GCG helps ensure that GOCCs remain financially sound

asr-000535
00:33:57.500 --> 00:34:01.120
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and responsive to national development policies.

asr-000536
00:34:02.340 --> 00:34:06.600
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Our proposed budget is an investment that enables the Governance Commission

asr-000537
00:34:06.600 --> 00:34:15.720
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: to continue safeguarding public resources and maximizing the value that GOCCs deliver to the Filipino people.

asr-000538
00:34:16.140 --> 00:34:18.620
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Guided by the vision of our President,

asr-000539
00:34:19.040 --> 00:34:23.800
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GCG remains committed to strengthening governance across the sector

asr-000540
00:34:23.800 --> 00:34:28.980
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and ensuring that every GOCC contributes meaningfully to nation-building.

asr-000541
00:34:29.820 --> 00:34:33.120
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: With your continued support, Your Honors, we can sustain these gains

asr-000542
00:34:33.120 --> 00:34:37.800
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and further advance a GOCC sector that delivers greater value,

asr-000543
00:34:38.700 --> 00:34:42.200
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: greater accountability, and greater service to the Filipino people.

asr-000544
00:34:43.000 --> 00:34:47.220
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: For these reasons, we respectfully seek the favorable consideration

asr-000545
00:34:47.220 --> 00:34:48.260
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: of the honorable

asr-000554
00:34:49.040 --> 00:34:51.160
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: subcommittee for the GCG's

asr-000555
00:34:51.160 --> 00:34:55.620
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: fiscal year 2027 proposed budget.

asr-000556
00:34:55.760 --> 00:34:57.340
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Thank you very much, Your Honor.

asr-000557
00:34:57.360 --> 00:34:58.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you, Attorney Corpus.

asr-000558
00:34:58.340 --> 00:34:58.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you very much.

asr-000559
00:34:59.820 --> 00:35:03.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Just a few questions and then we'll go to DTI.

asr-000560
00:35:03.380 --> 00:35:06.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I think the Chairman also has questions more for DTI than for GCG.

asr-000561
00:35:07.680 --> 00:35:15.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Of the 113 GOCCs in your purview, is that the correct word?

asr-000562
00:35:15.920 --> 00:35:17.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Or in your stable?

asr-000563
00:35:17.060 --> 00:35:17.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In your stable.

asr-000564
00:35:19.040 --> 00:35:26.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ilan po doon yung nag-remit sa gobyerno? Ilan po doon yung kailangan sustentuhan ng gobyerno?

asr-000565
00:35:26.520 --> 00:35:27.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Neto, Net.

asr-000566
00:35:28.600 --> 00:35:33.480
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, actually Your Honor, the count is down to 112.

asr-000567
00:35:33.980 --> 00:35:42.480
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Because GOCC, specifically if I recall right, the Philippine Aerospace Development Corporation

asr-000568
00:35:42.480 --> 00:35:49.600
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: had expired, its existence had expired early this year.

asr-000569
00:35:50.160 --> 00:35:53.420
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: So there are only 112 GOCCs left.

asr-000570
00:35:54.600 --> 00:36:00.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So of the 112, ilan po doon yung nag-remit at ilan po doon yung kailangan sustentuhan na neto?

asr-000571
00:36:01.460 --> 00:36:05.260
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, we have the list Your Honor, I don't have it with me right now.

asr-000572
00:36:06.120 --> 00:36:10.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Anybody can answer? Director Kenneth, for the record.

asr-000573
00:36:11.060 --> 00:36:12.220
GCG Director Kenneth M. Rafols: Hello, good afternoon.

asr-000574
00:36:12.480 --> 00:36:21.220
GCG Director Kenneth M. Rafols: As of 2025, 43 GOCCs remits dividends, then 27 is subsidized po.

asr-000575
00:36:22.180 --> 00:36:27.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Could you, like which GOCCs would have the biggest subsidies?

asr-000576
00:36:28.400 --> 00:36:33.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Just for the record lang para alam rin namin ni Chairperson JV.

asr-000577
00:36:35.560 --> 00:36:38.480
GCG Director Kenneth M. Rafols: For 2025, Senator, it's PhilHealth po.

asr-000578
00:36:39.120 --> 00:36:41.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: PhilHealth has the biggest subsidy?

asr-000579
00:36:41.520 --> 00:36:42.080
GCG Director Kenneth M. Rafols: Yes po.

asr-000580
00:36:42.080 --> 00:36:42.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And what else pa?

asr-000581
00:36:44.180 --> 00:36:47.760
GCG Director Kenneth M. Rafols: And National Irrigation Administration, or NIA po.

asr-000582
00:36:48.160 --> 00:36:48.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-000583
00:36:49.400 --> 00:36:58.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And tama ba, Attorney Corpus, is it the goal of all GOCCs to eventually be net positive

asr-000584
00:36:58.440 --> 00:37:00.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and remitting to the government or not necessarily?

asr-000585
00:37:01.540 --> 00:37:09.780
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Not necessarily, Your Honor, because there are certain GOCCs that have mandates that cater directly to the public

asr-000586
00:37:09.780 --> 00:37:11.780
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and for this they would need...

asr-000587
00:37:12.080 --> 00:37:13.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes po.

asr-000588
00:37:13.080 --> 00:37:17.980
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: ...subsidies from the national government, but we also monitor their performance in terms

asr-000589
00:37:17.980 --> 00:37:25.020
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: of their utilization of the subsidy allocated to them, if it is effective as far as...

asr-000590
00:37:25.020 --> 00:37:27.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Could you give us some examples, Attorney Corpus?

asr-000591
00:37:27.560 --> 00:37:30.920
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, the National Food Authority.

asr-000592
00:37:31.880 --> 00:37:34.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Can we have the National?

asr-000593
00:37:34.860 --> 00:37:36.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Anyone from your team can answer.

asr-000597
00:37:48.240 --> 00:37:57.960
GCG Corporate Standards Office Director IV Atty. Jocelyn Grace N. Navato: Yeah. For NFA po, for 2025, it received a subsidy of 14 billion, but it's performing its social

asr-000598
00:37:57.960 --> 00:38:01.380
GCG Corporate Standards Office Director IV Atty. Jocelyn Grace N. Navato: mandate of buffer stocking.

asr-000599
00:38:01.380 --> 00:38:06.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Well, we know that there were some issues with the NFA after the rice tarification law,

asr-000600
00:38:06.500 --> 00:38:07.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: di ba?

asr-000601
00:38:08.360 --> 00:38:09.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In any case,

asr-000602
00:38:09.680 --> 00:38:11.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: you assess every

asr-000603
00:38:11.100 --> 00:38:11.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: GOCC.

asr-000604
00:38:12.480 --> 00:38:22.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Some have a clear mandate that they should be remitting, and some, their mandate is based on their charter or based on the law that created them.

asr-000605
00:38:22.540 --> 00:38:23.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So you judge them differently.

asr-000606
00:38:24.420 --> 00:38:24.820
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000607
00:38:24.860 --> 00:38:30.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So it's not necessarily true that your ultimate indicator is how much you remit.

asr-000608
00:38:30.480 --> 00:38:35.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi usually, pag-GOCC, ang tinitinan ng tao, magkano ba yung nababalik sa gobyerno.

asr-000609
00:38:36.360 --> 00:38:37.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Tama ba yun, Atty. Marius?

asr-000610
00:38:37.480 --> 00:38:38.280
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000611
00:38:38.280 --> 00:38:49.980
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Then for the record, Your Honor, as far as the National Food Authority is concerned, their performance is actually improving for the past two years.

asr-000612
00:38:50.700 --> 00:38:53.800
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: There's an upward turn in their performance rating.

asr-000613
00:38:54.060 --> 00:39:02.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: When we say GOCC, it has the nature of a corporation, so they're allowed to engage in business, correct?

asr-000614
00:39:02.920 --> 00:39:07.500
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Our GOCC is allowed to engage in commercial operations, Your Honor.

asr-000615
00:39:07.500 --> 00:39:07.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes.

asr-000616
00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:16.740
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: But it's not necessarily the case that all GOCCs are expected to transact or expected to do commercial transactions.

asr-000617
00:39:16.900 --> 00:39:17.280
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Not necessarily.

asr-000618
00:39:17.280 --> 00:39:23.140
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: In fact, the classification of GOCCs are categorized into three.

asr-000619
00:39:23.680 --> 00:39:32.660
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Those that are subsidized by the national government, that those that are performing public functions but are allowed to engage in commercial activities,

asr-000620
00:39:33.260 --> 00:39:38.280
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and those that are engaged in commercial activities in competition

asr-000621
00:39:38.280 --> 00:39:39.680
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: with the private sector.

asr-000622
00:39:40.080 --> 00:39:50.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we saw in your presentation that over the past 12 years, the remittances have grown higher, correct?

asr-000623
00:39:50.200 --> 00:39:51.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Which is, of course, an accomplishment.

asr-000624
00:39:52.580 --> 00:40:02.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But, siguro if we leave that as our only or as our main metric, it will create the impression that all GOCCs need to remit, which is not necessarily the case.

asr-000625
00:40:02.760 --> 00:40:02.920
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Sure.

asr-000626
00:40:02.920 --> 00:40:07.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, in your assessment of the 113, now 112 GOCCs,

asr-000627
00:40:08.280 --> 00:40:12.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: are all of them hitting their mandates?

asr-000628
00:40:13.680 --> 00:40:18.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Setting aside the remittance part, kasi hindi naman lahat expected na mag-remit.

asr-000629
00:40:19.520 --> 00:40:21.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: How would you categorize them?

asr-000630
00:40:21.360 --> 00:40:30.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Like, how many would be high-performing, satisfactory, and how many would be performing under the standards that you have set?

asr-000631
00:40:30.860 --> 00:40:32.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because this is really the job of GCG, di ba?

asr-000632
00:40:32.560 --> 00:40:33.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: To monitor all of them.

asr-000633
00:40:33.860 --> 00:40:34.240
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000634
00:40:35.040 --> 00:40:38.040
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Well, as of now, Your Honor,

asr-000635
00:40:38.280 --> 00:40:44.780
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: unfortunately, there are some GOCCs that are, you know, not really performing up to par.

asr-000636
00:40:45.880 --> 00:41:00.540
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: And, in fact, the performance rate, as I have stated, Ariel, is about 67 percent, which is an improvement from previous years, Your Honor.

asr-000637
00:41:00.540 --> 00:41:07.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yeah, would you be able, just for the record, no, if you could help us understand of the 112,

asr-000638
00:41:08.280 --> 00:41:11.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: ano yung category ng performance nila, based on your assessment?

asr-000639
00:41:11.860 --> 00:41:13.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi that's not in this, it's not in your slides.

asr-000640
00:41:14.240 --> 00:41:14.500
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes.

asr-000641
00:41:14.780 --> 00:41:16.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yeah, would you be able to submit that to the...

asr-000642
00:41:16.380 --> 00:41:17.460
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, Your Honor, maybe.

asr-000643
00:41:17.460 --> 00:41:23.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Para lang the senators are also advised on the performance of these GOCCs.

asr-000644
00:41:23.620 --> 00:41:24.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Could you give us an example?

asr-000645
00:41:24.760 --> 00:41:32.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kunyari, what's an example in your assessment of a top-performing or the most top-performing GOCC,

asr-000646
00:41:32.920 --> 00:41:37.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: isang maybe middle, mid-level, and one that needs...

asr-000647
00:41:38.280 --> 00:41:41.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: greater improvement. Para lang for our appreciation also.

asr-000648
00:41:41.620 --> 00:41:42.020
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000649
00:41:42.860 --> 00:41:47.060
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Every year, Your Honor, we have this annual GOCC Awards,

asr-000650
00:41:47.620 --> 00:41:53.600
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and we recognize the top-performing GOCCs in terms of the performance evaluation system,

asr-000651
00:41:54.080 --> 00:41:58.480
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and also with respect to their compliance with the corporate governance scorecard.

asr-000652
00:41:59.100 --> 00:42:03.020
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: An example of a top-performing GOCC, Your Honor, would be Land Bank.

asr-000653
00:42:03.500 --> 00:42:05.360
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: It has been consistently in the...

asr-000654
00:42:05.360 --> 00:42:06.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For multiple years, I'm sure, no?

asr-000655
00:42:06.720 --> 00:42:07.780
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000656
00:42:08.280 --> 00:42:14.940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: An example of a GOCC that is in the middle would be PhilHealth.

asr-000657
00:42:16.200 --> 00:42:20.620
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: For several years, it has not been performing quite well,

asr-000658
00:42:21.260 --> 00:42:25.420
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: but now we see an improved performance, but although it has not achieved,

asr-000659
00:42:25.860 --> 00:42:32.740
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: because to be able to qualify for the performance evaluation system award,

asr-000660
00:42:32.740 --> 00:42:38.260
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: you have to reach a rating of 90%, 90% or above.

asr-000661
00:42:38.280 --> 00:42:43.280
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: For PhilHealth, I think it's about 70%.

asr-000662
00:42:44.060 --> 00:42:46.600
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Nasa 70% pa lang sila.

asr-000663
00:42:46.780 --> 00:42:50.440
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: But up from a lower percentage of performance.

asr-000664
00:42:50.600 --> 00:42:51.380
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: 61 daw po.

asr-000665
00:42:52.180 --> 00:42:55.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Let me recognize Senator Rafi Tulfo, who's also joining us today.

asr-000666
00:42:56.500 --> 00:42:58.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Senator Tulfo, we have GCG.

asr-000667
00:42:59.100 --> 00:42:59.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Good afternoon, Senator.

asr-000668
00:42:59.840 --> 00:43:03.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We're actually wrapping up already, then we'll have the DTI presentation shortly.

asr-000669
00:43:04.200 --> 00:43:05.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sige po, Attorney.

asr-000670
00:43:05.280 --> 00:43:07.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yung low-performing...

asr-000671
00:43:08.280 --> 00:43:10.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Anyway, tayo-tayo lang naman nandito.

asr-000672
00:43:10.620 --> 00:43:11.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi natin ilalabas sa...

asr-000673
00:43:11.940 --> 00:43:12.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Joke lang.

asr-000674
00:43:12.800 --> 00:43:13.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Off the record?

asr-000675
00:43:13.340 --> 00:43:16.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For planning purposes, para alam natin.

asr-000676
00:43:18.660 --> 00:43:19.660
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Marawi Resorts.

asr-000677
00:43:21.060 --> 00:43:22.360
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Marawi Resort Hotel.

asr-000678
00:43:22.680 --> 00:43:24.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Marawi Resort Hotel is a GOCC?

asr-000679
00:43:24.680 --> 00:43:25.320
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000680
00:43:25.600 --> 00:43:30.460
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: But the BARM government is planning to acquire the...

asr-000681
00:43:30.460 --> 00:43:31.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: When was that?

asr-000682
00:43:31.640 --> 00:43:32.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Was that after the siege?

asr-000683
00:43:32.780 --> 00:43:34.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It was created after the siege or before the siege?

asr-000684
00:43:34.140 --> 00:43:34.960
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: No, no. Matagal na po.

asr-000685
00:43:34.960 --> 00:43:35.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Oh, even before pa?

asr-000686
00:43:35.980 --> 00:43:36.520
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Even before.

asr-000687
00:43:36.900 --> 00:43:37.960
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: It used to be...

asr-000688
00:43:38.280 --> 00:43:42.920
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: A very well-maintained resorts but somehow it deteriorated.

asr-000689
00:43:43.300 --> 00:43:49.460
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: And based on our yearly evaluation, hindi ko masyadong...

asr-000690
00:43:49.460 --> 00:43:51.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Medyo falling short siya of your standards.

