Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We don't want to create another layer.

asr-001863
01:07:28.140 --> 01:07:32.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's why the suggestion ni Sen. Tulfo, in which you also suggested before,

asr-001864
01:07:32.140 --> 01:07:35.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: is huwag na siyang mandatory for the small.

asr-001865
01:07:35.140 --> 01:07:39.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If you want to do it mandatory for the medium and large,

asr-001866
01:07:39.140 --> 01:07:41.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kayang-kaya nila yung 1,000 pesos.

asr-001867
01:07:41.140 --> 01:07:43.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But ang worry namin is para sa small,

asr-001868
01:07:43.140 --> 01:07:45.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: firstly, it's an extra expense.

asr-001869
01:07:45.140 --> 01:07:47.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And secondly, it's an extra step.

asr-001870
01:07:47.140 --> 01:07:49.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Eh, gusto nga natin bawasan yung mga steps

asr-001871
01:07:49.140 --> 01:07:51.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: para mas madali magdegosyo.

asr-001872
01:07:51.140 --> 01:07:54.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Eventually, I think people will understand that

asr-001873
01:07:54.140 --> 01:07:57.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: if there's a Trustmark, they can trust the product more.

asr-001874
01:07:57.140 --> 01:08:01.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero that can be, tama ba caveat emptor na yan, diba?

asr-001875
01:08:01.140 --> 01:08:04.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's already the purview of the buyer.

asr-001876
01:08:04.140 --> 01:08:05.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Tama ba? Tama ba yung Latin ko?

asr-001877
01:08:05.140 --> 01:08:06.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Caveat emptor, tama diba?

asr-001878
01:08:06.140 --> 01:08:08.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Bahala na yung buyer.

asr-001879
01:08:08.140 --> 01:08:14.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, when will you release the DO?

asr-001880
01:08:14.140 --> 01:08:18.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because your current DO says that it will be mandatory next year.

asr-001881
01:08:18.140 --> 01:08:21.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I hope by the time we get to plenary,

asr-001882
01:08:21.140 --> 01:08:24.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: there's already more visibility

asr-001883
01:08:24.140 --> 01:08:27.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that we won't make it mandatory anymore

asr-001884
01:08:27.140 --> 01:08:29.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: for the small and the micro.

asr-001885
01:08:29.140 --> 01:08:31.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's our suggestion, Secretary.

asr-001886
01:08:31.140 --> 01:08:33.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, pag nagkita tayo sa plenary,

asr-001887
01:08:33.140 --> 01:08:35.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I hope we can resolve that already.

asr-001888
01:08:38.140 --> 01:08:40.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The more steps kasi we have,

asr-001889
01:08:40.140 --> 01:08:42.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: it's really going to be difficult.

asr-001890
01:08:42.140 --> 01:08:45.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Plus, ito magiging problema ni ASEC.

asr-001891
01:08:45.140 --> 01:08:49.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Let's say, bumili ako ng Trustmark.

asr-001892
01:08:49.140 --> 01:08:53.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Talaga bang ma-assure natin na just because bumili ako ng Trustmark,

asr-001893
01:08:53.140 --> 01:08:55.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: ay katiwa-tiwala na yung produktong yan.

asr-001894
01:08:55.140 --> 01:08:59.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kailangan malinaw na malinaw na pag may Trustmark ako,

asr-001895
01:08:59.140 --> 01:09:04.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that it's really above the rest of the market.

asr-001896
01:09:04.140 --> 01:09:06.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And I'm not sure if you can assure that, diba?

asr-001897
01:09:06.140 --> 01:09:08.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, may ano rin yan.

asr-001898
01:09:08.140 --> 01:09:11.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: May possible pitfall rin yun yung pagkakaroon ng Trustmark.

asr-001899
01:09:11.140 --> 01:09:14.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kung yung medium, kaya nyo talagang ma-assess yan isa-isa.

asr-001900
01:09:15.140 --> 01:09:17.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero kung yung small, papatrustmark ninyo,

asr-001901
01:09:17.140 --> 01:09:23.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kaya nyo ba talagang i-assess lahat ng libo-libong mag-a-apply sa inyo?

asr-001902
01:09:23.140 --> 01:09:26.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, that's just some possible pitfalls moving forward.

asr-001903
01:09:26.140 --> 01:09:29.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, I would suggest, bigyan nyo ng Trustmark,

asr-001904
01:09:29.140 --> 01:09:35.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: yung talagang kaya nyo sabihin na this product is really top standard,

asr-001905
01:09:35.140 --> 01:09:37.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: hindi nito masisira at lahat-lahat.

asr-001906
01:09:37.140 --> 01:09:43.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And again, if it's for medium or even the larger enterprises, big purchases,

asr-001907
01:09:43.140 --> 01:09:44.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: then why not?

asr-001908
01:09:44.140 --> 01:09:49.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero for the small, yung mga produktong nabibili natin,

asr-001909
01:09:49.140 --> 01:09:52.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: parang almost impulse purchase na yung mga yan,

asr-001910
01:09:52.140 --> 01:09:54.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I would tread carefully.

asr-001911
01:09:54.140 --> 01:09:56.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi once you have that Trustmark,

asr-001912
01:09:56.140 --> 01:10:01.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: you have to assure also that lahat yan will fall under the right standards.

asr-001913
01:10:01.140 --> 01:10:06.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In my mind, considering yung dami ninyo at yung dami ng mga negosyo at dami ng produkto,

asr-001914
01:10:06.140 --> 01:10:09.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: parang hindi talaga siya nagmamatch.

asr-001915
01:10:09.140 --> 01:10:11.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, I hope you can work with the Secretary on that.

asr-001916
01:10:11.140 --> 01:10:12.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang suggestion ko is,

asr-001917
01:10:12.140 --> 01:10:14.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: maganda na yung direction,

asr-001918
01:10:14.140 --> 01:10:16.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: keep it to the bigger businesses,

asr-001919
01:10:16.140 --> 01:10:18.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and then yung mga smaller businesses,

asr-001920
01:10:18.140 --> 01:10:20.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: let it be voluntary on their part.

asr-001921
01:10:20.140 --> 01:10:22.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Do you want to respond, Sir Asec?

asr-001922
01:10:22.140 --> 01:10:25.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Baka may mga blind spot kami hindi nakikita.

asr-001923
01:10:25.140 --> 01:10:26.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Go ahead.

asr-001924
01:10:26.140 --> 01:10:28.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Tama po yun, Senator.

asr-001925
01:10:28.140 --> 01:10:30.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We will comply with that.

asr-001926
01:10:30.140 --> 01:10:33.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: I totally agree with you on this.

asr-001927
01:10:33.140 --> 01:10:34.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Salamat.

asr-001928
01:10:34.140 --> 01:10:36.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sir, you want to respond?

asr-001929
01:10:36.140 --> 01:10:37.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yun na yun?

asr-001930
01:10:37.140 --> 01:10:38.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yun na yun?

asr-001931
01:10:38.140 --> 01:10:39.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay, sige.

asr-001932
01:10:39.140 --> 01:10:40.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, let's begin.

asr-001933
01:10:40.140 --> 01:10:41.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Secretary, you have the floor.

asr-001934
01:10:41.140 --> 01:10:45.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hopefully, we can keep it to maybe 15 minutes, no?

asr-001935
01:10:45.140 --> 01:10:46.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yeah.

asr-001936
01:10:46.140 --> 01:10:50.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair and members of the committee.

asr-001937
01:10:50.140 --> 01:10:53.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: For fiscal year 2027,

asr-001938
01:10:53.140 --> 01:10:59.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the proposed budget of the Department of Trade and Industry is 10.903 billion,

asr-001939
01:10:59.140 --> 01:11:03.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: composed of 7 billion for DTI, OSEC,

asr-001940
01:11:03.140 --> 01:11:07.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and 2.131 billion for attached agencies,

asr-001941
01:11:07.140 --> 01:11:13.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and 1.7363 billion for attached corporations.

asr-001942
01:11:13.140 --> 01:11:16.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: This budget supports DTI's priorities.

asr-001943
01:11:16.140 --> 01:11:18.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, we have three priorities.

asr-001944
01:11:18.140 --> 01:11:20.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Expand foreign trade and investments,

asr-001945
01:11:20.140 --> 01:11:23.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: protect consumers and ensure fair trade,

asr-001946
01:11:23.140 --> 01:11:27.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and develop competitive MSMEs and local industries.

asr-001947
01:11:27.140 --> 01:11:33.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: For the performance for 2025 and fiscal year 2026,

asr-001948
01:11:33.140 --> 01:11:35.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: first semester,

asr-001949
01:11:35.140 --> 01:11:36.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: DTI…

asr-001950
01:11:36.140 --> 01:11:40.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: allow me to highlight our major achievements in these three areas.

asr-001951
01:11:40.140 --> 01:11:42.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: First, on trade and investments,

asr-001952
01:11:42.140 --> 01:11:49.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Philippine exports reached 135.93 billion U.S. dollars in 2025,

asr-001953
01:11:49.140 --> 01:11:53.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: composed of 84.44 billion in goods export

asr-001954
01:11:53.140 --> 01:11:59.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and 51.49 billion U.S. dollars in services exports.

asr-001955
01:11:59.140 --> 01:12:00.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: For 2026,

asr-001956
01:12:00.140 --> 01:12:06.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the momentum continued with goods export reaching 54.92 billion U.S. dollars,

asr-001957
01:12:06.140 --> 01:12:08.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: as of July 2026,

asr-001958
01:12:08.140 --> 01:12:14.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: while services reached 23.31 billion U.S. dollars as of June 2026.

asr-001959
01:12:14.140 --> 01:12:20.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In 2025, Philippine exports reached all-time high, 15.4%.

asr-001960
01:12:20.140 --> 01:12:23.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We carried this momentum straight in 2026

asr-001961
01:12:23.140 --> 01:12:27.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: with monthly exports growing at January 8.7,

asr-001962
01:12:27.140 --> 01:12:29.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: February 8.9%,

asr-001963
01:12:29.140 --> 01:12:31.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: March 20.4%,

asr-001964
01:12:31.140 --> 01:12:33.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: April 7.2%,

asr-001965
01:12:33.140 --> 01:12:35.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: May 7.6,

asr-001966
01:12:35.140 --> 01:12:37.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: June 24.1,

asr-001967
01:12:37.140 --> 01:12:38.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: July 10.8,

asr-001968
01:12:38.140 --> 01:12:39.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and August is up,

asr-001969
01:12:39.140 --> 01:12:43.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: but PCA will announce tomorrow the exact figure.

asr-001970
01:12:43.140 --> 01:12:47.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Semiconductors, electronic, automotive parts, and minerals

asr-001971
01:12:47.140 --> 01:12:50.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: continue to account for a significant share of our exports,

asr-001972
01:12:50.140 --> 01:12:54.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: but we have seen a lot of wins in the agriculture exports,

asr-001973
01:12:54.140 --> 01:12:58.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: particularly coconut, banana, pineapples, ube, and calamansi.

asr-001974
01:12:58.140 --> 01:13:02.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But we are pushing also for bamboo.

asr-001975
01:13:02.140 --> 01:13:03.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Just this year,

asr-001976
01:13:03.140 --> 01:13:04.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we also sent our first shipments

asr-001977
01:13:04.140 --> 01:13:08.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: of fresh mangoes to Canada.

asr-001978
01:13:08.140 --> 01:13:11.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 400 kilos we started a month ago,

asr-001979
01:13:11.140 --> 01:13:13.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and then last two weeks,

asr-001980
01:13:13.140 --> 01:13:17.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we shipped also one metric tons of fresh mangoes,

asr-001981
01:13:17.140 --> 01:13:19.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and then we'll see how it goes.

asr-001982
01:13:19.140 --> 01:13:23.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We also shipped 150 kilos to Brussels, Europe,

asr-001983
01:13:23.140 --> 01:13:27.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and now we have an inquiry from UAE

asr-001984
01:13:27.140 --> 01:13:31.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for two metric tons of fresh mangoes.

asr-001985
01:13:31.140 --> 01:13:33.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So again, durian mangosteen also to Canada,

asr-001986
01:13:33.140 --> 01:13:35.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and we also had it.

asr-001987
01:13:35.140 --> 01:13:39.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Then the success of our exporters creates opportunities

asr-001988
01:13:39.140 --> 01:13:41.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and income for farmers,

asr-001989
01:13:41.140 --> 01:13:43.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: creates jobs in rural communities,

asr-001990
01:13:43.140 --> 01:13:47.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and strengthens local supply chains across the country.

asr-001991
01:13:47.140 --> 01:13:48.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: For example,

asr-001992
01:13:48.140 --> 01:13:51.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: one exporter supported by DTI

asr-001993
01:13:51.140 --> 01:13:55.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: has expanded the business from 2023 to last year

asr-001994
01:13:55.140 --> 01:13:58.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: by times four during this administration.

asr-001995
01:13:58.140 --> 01:14:00.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So to meet the growing demand,

asr-001996
01:14:00.140 --> 01:14:03.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: the company sources an average of 600 metric tons

asr-001997
01:14:03.140 --> 01:14:06.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: of agriculture imports per month

asr-001998
01:14:06.140 --> 01:14:08.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: from farmers and communities,

asr-001999
01:14:08.140 --> 01:14:10.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and they deliver on a daily basis

asr-002000
01:14:10.140 --> 01:14:12.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: these small enterprises.

asr-002001
01:14:12.140 --> 01:14:15.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we encourage the small enterprises

asr-002002
01:14:15.140 --> 01:14:17.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to supply the exporters

asr-002003
01:14:17.140 --> 01:14:21.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: so that they can actually move their products also.

asr-002004
01:14:21.140 --> 01:14:23.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And since ang produce nila maliit lang,

asr-002005
01:14:23.140 --> 01:14:25.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: they can supply on a daily basis,

asr-002006
01:14:25.140 --> 01:14:28.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: which is fine for a lot of these exporters.

asr-002007
01:14:28.140 --> 01:14:31.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We will continue to open doors for exporters.

asr-002008
01:14:31.140 --> 01:14:32.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Under this administration,

asr-002009
01:14:32.140 --> 01:14:37.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: is set to make history and 23 free trade agreements.

asr-002010
01:14:37.140 --> 01:14:38.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: This year alone,

asr-002011
01:14:38.140 --> 01:14:41.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: we will hope to conclude the JPEPA,

asr-002012
01:14:41.140 --> 01:14:43.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and we have also seen the conclusion

asr-002013
01:14:43.140 --> 01:14:44.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: in the European,

asr-002014
01:14:44.140 --> 01:14:46.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Philippine-European FTA.

asr-002015
01:14:46.140 --> 01:14:49.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We signed the Philippine-Chile FTA

asr-002016
01:14:49.140 --> 01:14:51.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: that will open the South America market.

asr-002017
01:14:51.140 --> 01:14:55.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Then we also have the ASEAN trade in goods agreement.

asr-002018
01:14:55.140 --> 01:14:58.140
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So there are a lot of FTAs in place,

asr-002019
01:14:58.140 --> 01:15:00.000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: but we will end by

asr-002020
01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:02.500
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: 23 by this year

asr-002021
01:15:02.500 --> 01:15:03.460
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: concluded.

asr-002022
01:15:04.260 --> 01:15:06.580
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Aside from market access, our exporters

asr-002023
01:15:06.580 --> 01:15:08.360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: must still connect with buyers,

asr-002024
01:15:08.540 --> 01:15:10.460
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: showcase their products, and secure orders.

asr-002025
01:15:10.960 --> 01:15:12.460
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We are proposing an

asr-002026
01:15:12.460 --> 01:15:14.340
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: additional budget of 100 million

asr-002027
